X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Livemusicasheville": "https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/live-jazz-tuesday-jay-sanders-will-boyd-zack-page-alan-hall-4-2-3/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:livemusicasheville
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T220000
DTSTAMP:20260421T101745
CREATED:20250624T071658Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T141828Z
UID:10014015-1776798000-1776808800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Live Jazz Tuesday: Jay Sanders' Empyrean Trio
DESCRIPTION:The Empyrean Trio ascends to the highest sphere of musical expression\, where Sanders\, Page\, and Hall commune in the celestial realm of pure improvisation. Like ancient philosophers who believed the empyrean was the highest heaven—a place of fire and light beyond the physical world—this trio inhabits the ethereal space where earthbound genres dissolve into transcendent musical dialogue. \nTheir original compositions float between the terrestrial and the sublime\, oscillating from groove-laden explorations that anchor listeners to the physical realm\, to free-form adventures that lift consciousness into the empyrean heights of pure sonic possibility. Through jazz\, rock\, blues\, and world music influences refined by years of improvisational alchemy\, the trio channels the luminous fire of creative spontaneity. \nIn this rarefied atmosphere\, Sanders’ guitar becomes a conduit between the material and immaterial\, Page’s bass provides the gravitational pull that keeps the music tethered to human experience\, while Hall’s percussion creates the rhythmic cosmos in which their empyrean visions unfold. \nThe Empyrean Trio: \n\nZack Page – Acoustic & Electric Bass\nAlan Hall – Drums\nJay Sanders – Guitar and Effects\n\n\nTogether: architecture in four dimensions. Three virtuosos deciding atmospheric constraints are suggestions that can be ignored with sufficient escape velocity.\n\n\n\n\n\nEvery Monday and Tuesday\, Little Jumbo brings live jazz to your ears. littlejumbobar.com \n“Simply put\, Little Jumbo should be at the top of your list of places for cocktails in Asheville. The drinks and service are both top-notch\, and the atmosphere is reminiscent of a relaxed speakeasy\, without a trace of the pretention that can sometimes be found in such places.” ~ The SmokyMountains.com Local Expert Team
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/live-jazz-tuesday-jay-sanders-will-boyd-zack-page-alan-hall-4-2-3/
LOCATION:Little Jumbo\, 241 Broadway St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/up9t0406qz0empgsjjx3dg6d9lm1-e1771426474902.jpg
GEO:35.6024336;-82.5568463
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Little Jumbo 241 Broadway St Asheville NC 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=241 Broadway St:geo:-82.5568463,35.6024336
END:VEVENT
