CREATED:20250309T145031Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T140019Z
UID:10027824-1776826800-1776913199@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Ask About Our Featured Listings
DESCRIPTION:Established in February 2019\, LiveMusicAsheville.com now reaches thousands of people every week actively searching for live music in the Asheville area. Roughly 60% of our traffic comes from Google Search as we dominate the top of the results for queries such as “Asheville live music” & “live music Asheville”. Meanwhile our direct traffic is experiencing explosive growth\, proving more locals are now using us as their go-to music calendar. \nOur free listings include just the basics of Who’s Playin’ Where & When. We offer Descriptive Listings at just $5 per event to help you guide viewers to your event. These listings include up to 30 words but do not include links.  \nOur Featured Listings really stand out among the dozens of events on the calendar every day. While we update every Wednesday for the following Friday thru Thursday\, these Featured Listings are published much sooner and include your picture or poster\, a description of the event and the venue\, website/ticket links and a Google map. We also share these events on our social media stories to help further promote your show. \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/ask-about-our-featured-listings/2026-04-22/
LOCATION:LiveMusicAsheville.com\, ASHEVILLE\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Fairview,Live Music,Madison County,Mills River,South Asheville/Arden/Fletcher,Weaverville
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_4145-e1770855289327.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="LiveMusicAsheville.com":MAILTO:livemusicasheville@gmail.com
GEO:35.5671423;-82.5437614
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Livemusicasheville": "https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-april-24th-sneaky-miles/2026-04-22/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:livemusicasheville
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260422
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260424
DTSTAMP:20260421T101745
CREATED:20260403T153423Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T153423Z
UID:10054800-1776826800-1776913199@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING FRIDAY April 24th | Sneaky Miles
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, Apr 24\, 9pm-12am | $10 Cover Event Details and Tickets \nSneaky Miles is an indie folk band formed through open mic nights at the University of New Hampshire in the fall of 2019. Since forming\, Sneaky Miles has quickly become a local powerhouse in the New Hampshire Seacoast music scene.\n\nWhile the band began as a stripped-down trio\, Sneaky Miles has since expanded their live sound by teaming up with additional members on drums\, bass\, and pedal steel. The result is a high-energy performance and a sound that feels bigger than the sum of its parts\, blending heartfelt storytelling with driving folk-rock arrangements.\n\nFor fans of Caamp\, Noah Kahan\, The Lumineers\, Mumford & Sons\, and The Head and the Heart\, Sneaky Miles delivers a sound rooted in community\, connection\, and cathartic live shows. sneakymiles.com\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-april-24th-sneaky-miles/2026-04-22/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/637779410_1494734775994733_3750430347465596623_n-e1775229958454.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
