SUMMARY:The RAD Walk: Movement\, Kindness\, and Fresh Air
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nWe will be starting at **229 Riverside D
 r.** and walking a loop that takes us past Hi-Wire toward Amboy Road\, thr
 ough French Broad River Park\, and back via Craven Street.\n\n* **Total Di
 stance:** Approximately 4 miles (but your distance is your choice).\n* **T
 ime:** About 1.5 hours.\n* **Flexibility:** Remember\, this is your walk. 
 If 4 miles feels like too much\, you can turn around at any point (like wh
 en we reach Hi-Wire) to head back to the start.\n\nWe will meet at the loc
 ation in the event picture.\nDon't forget the suntan lotion if it's a sunn
 y day :)\nWe will wait 10 minutes after the event time\, and then we start
  the walk.\n\n\\*Please keep an eye on this meetup event for any updates i
 f weather isn't ideal. If there is rain\, we will probably reschedule.
