SUMMARY:GDG - AVL - Google Developer Group
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Tech Events\n**Brought to you by the fresh and new A
 sheville chapter Google Developer Group!**\n\n[Vibe coding is more addicti
 ve than any video game ever made (if you know what you want to build). ~Na
 val](https://x.com/naval/status/2039617101221224858)\n\n**AI Build Sprint*
 * :: learn by building.\n\n**The Details** \\* **When:** Sunday\\\, April 
 26 \\| 11:00 AM – 3:00 PM\n\n* **Cost:** Free (BYO coffee/snacks)\n* **W
 ho:** YOU! Yeah\, you! (from absolute beginners to seasoned devs)\n\n**The
  Schedule** \\* **11:00 AM:** Pitch ideas & form teams\n\n* **11:50 AM:** 
 Build Sprint (AI-assisted coding)\n* **2:30 PM:** Demos & Deployments\n\n*
 *What to Bring** \\* Laptop + charger + ideas & dreams\n\n***Note:*** *Col
 laborative chaos is expected\, but kindness is required. Keep it friendly\
 , respectful\, and constructive.*\n\n[To build product\, “make something
  people want.” To create art\, make something *you* want. (The best do b
 oth). ~Naval](https://x.com/naval/status/1889774472879624671)
