DESCRIPTION:For over four decades\, GWAR has built one of the most outrage
 ous\, unforgettable brands in music history. Beneath bloody cannons and al
 ien warlord costumes lies something even more powerful: a truly shared vis
 ion and driving direction\, meaningful collaboration and a fearless dedica
 tion to creativity. Michael Bishop (Blöthar the Berserker) — bassist\, 
 vocalist\, and long-time creative force behind GWAR — for a behind-the-s
 cenes conversation about how an art-school experiment became a 40-year glo
 bal 
