SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Esmae
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 3rd\n\n1st Dance W
 ave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wav
 e 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Esmae \\(
 Megan Belling\\\, Facilitator Pathway\\) \\| Support Facilitator TBA\nInte
 ntion: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at War
 m up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive lat
 e will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure conta
 iner. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned aw
 ay for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteer
 s. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.
 org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydG
