 lddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEME
 NTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note:
  NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbnd
 xM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446
 YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC
 :\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony w
 here all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. 
 Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community thro
 ugh free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community tran
 sformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the d
 ance floor!
