 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest
  DJ Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator TBA\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*
 \\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly
  at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be o
 n time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 -
  $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-reg
 istration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djs
 eigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid
 =IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE
