 lic options. Explore the studio\, see where glass comes to life\, and conn
 ect with others in a unique creative space. Asher Holman\, a San Francisco
  native\, discovered glassblowing at 16 through Public Glass\, where the m
 edium’s physicality and artistic community inspired his career path. He 
 earned a BA in studio art with a focus in glass from Centre College in 201
 7\, s
