X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/312930068/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_312930068@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T141740Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260602T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260602T193000
SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club!
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**June Selection - *Is A River Alive?: A J
 ourney with Water* by Robert Macfarlane**\n\nAt the heart of Is a River Al
 ive? is a single\, transformative idea: that rivers are not mere matter fo
 r human use\, but living beings\, who should be recognized as such in both
  imagination and law. Macfarlane takes the reader on a mind-expanding glob
 al journey into the history\, futures\, people and places of the ancient\,
  urgent concept.\n\n**Welcome** to our robust and engaging Book Club! We'r
 e a small\, friendly group dedicated to fostering lively discussions about
  our monthly book selections. Whether you've read the entire book\, just a
  few chapters\, or even if you're simply curious about the title\, we'd lo
 ve to have you join us!\n\n**Meeting Schedule**: We gather on the First Tu
 esday of every month for our book discussions.\n\nWhat sets us apart is ou
 r small group size and directed discussions. This intimate setting allows 
 for deeper\, more engaging conversations where everyone's voice can be hea
 rd. It's the perfect environment for those who love to dive deep into them
 es\, characters\, and the intricacies of storytelling.\n\nSo whether you'r
 e a seasoned bookworm or just dipping your toes into the world of literatu
 re\, we invite you to join us. Let's explore new worlds\, challenge our pe
 rspectives\, and forge new friendships - one book at a time!\n\n**July Pic
 k: Book Swap & Planning!**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/312930068/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260117T165123Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260117T165123Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
